       FUNCTION create_new_file()
           CLEAR text_area content from line 1 to end
       END FUNCTION

       FUNCTION open_file()
           PROMPT user to select a file to open
           IF user selects a file THEN
               OPEN file in read mode
               SET content to the entire file content
               CLEAR text_area content from line 1 to end
               INSERT content into text_area at the end
           ENDIF
       END FUNCTION

       FUNCTION save_file()
           PROMPT user to select a file to save
           IF user selects a file THEN
               OPEN file in write mode
               SET content to text_area content
               WRITE content to the file
           ENDIF
       END FUNCTION
   END CLASS
   ```
   - **Key Functionality:**
     - The `TextEditor` class allows users to create a new text file, open an existing text file, and save the current text to a file. It leverages the `tkinter` library for GUI components and the `filedialog` for opening and saving files.
